given-names></name><name><surname>Desrues</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Bretagne</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1999</year><article-title>Tracheobronchial stenting in patients with esophageal cancer involving the central airways.</article-title><source>Endoscopy</source><volume>31</volume><fpage>232</fpage><lpage>236</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10344427</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003101-Chan1"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>KP</given-names></name><name><surname>Eng</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Hsu</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name><name><surname>Huat</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name><name><surname>Chow</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Rigid bronchoscopy and stenting for esophageal cancer causing airway obstruction.</article-title><source>Chest</source><volume>122</volume><fpage>1069</fpage><lpage>1072</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12226055</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003101-DeOlabozal1"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>De Olabozal</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Roberts</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoeltgen</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Berkelhammer</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Double stenting to prevent airway compression in proximal malignant esophageal strictures.</article-title><source>Am J Gastroenterol</source><volume>96</volume><fpage>2800</fpage><lpage>2801</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11569723</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003101-Nomori1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-g